      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Validates a string ID against the appropriate language string table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If expansion table (DAT_6fc50c24) loaded and wStringId > 19999, validate against expansion table with offset -20000\n2. If patch table (DAT_6fc50c20) loaded and wStringId > 9999, validate against patch table with offset -10000\n3. Otherwise validate against base string table (DAT_6fc50c04), asserting it's not NULL\n\nParameters:\n- wStringId (ushort): String identifier to validate (0-65535 range)\n\nReturns:\n- void (validation errors handled internally via assertion/exit)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4E20 (20000): Expansion string ID threshold\n- 0x2710 (10000): Patch string ID threshold\n- 0xB1E0 (-20000): Expansion table offset adjustment\n- 0xD8F0 (-10000): Patch table offset adjustment\n- 0x25F (607): Source line number for assert",
