      "name": "ValidateFileHandle",
      "signature": "void ValidateFileHandle(int nReserved, int hFile)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Validates that a file handle is non-null and valid.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Assert that hFile is not NULL, exit on failure\n2. Call Ordinal_10105 to validate the file handle\n3. If validation fails, retrieve file path via Ordinal_276 and log error\n4. Exit with -1 on any validation failure\n\nParameters:\n- nReserved (int): Unused parameter (passed via ECX)\n- hFile (int): File handle to validate (passed via EDX)\n\nReturns:\n- void: Function only returns on success, exits on failure\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10023: FOG assertion failure\n- Ordinal_10105: FOG file handle validation\n- Ordinal_276: Storm SFileGetFilePath\n- Ordinal_10026: FOG error logging",
