      "name": "IsCharAlphaType",
      "signature": "uint IsCharAlphaType(int nCharCode)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Checks if a character has alpha character type flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If locale mode > 1 (multi-byte), delegate to extended type check\n2. Otherwise, look up char type flags from g_pwCharTypeTable\n3. Return flags masked with 0x103 (alpha type bits)\n\nParameters:\n- nCharCode (int): Character code to check\n\nReturns:\n- Non-zero if character is alphabetic, 0 otherwise\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x103: Alpha character type mask (uppercase | lowercase bits)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
