      "name": "InitializeStaticCriticalSections",
      "signature": "void InitializeStaticCriticalSections(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes four static critical sections used for thread synchronization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load InitializeCriticalSection address into ESI\n2. Call InitializeCriticalSection for g_pCritSect1\n3. Call InitializeCriticalSection for g_pCritSect2\n4. Call InitializeCriticalSection for g_pCritSect3\n5. Call InitializeCriticalSection for g_pCritSect4\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fc45365: Deletes these critical sections during cleanup",
