      "name": "DeleteAllCriticalSections",
      "signature": "void DeleteAllCriticalSections(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Cleans up all critical sections in the global CRT lock table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Iterate through g_apCritSectTable (0x6fc4e138 to 0x6fc4e1f8)\n2. For each non-null entry, skip special sections (indices 0x11, 0x0d, 0x09, 0x01)\n3. Delete remaining sections and free memory via FUN_6fc4719c\n4. Delete the 4 special critical sections in specific order\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nNotes:\n- Called during CRT shutdown (from cleanup function with TlsFree)\n- The 4 skipped sections are deleted last to avoid race conditions\n- Array spans 48 entries (0xC0 bytes / 4 bytes per pointer)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
