      "name": "LockCrtCriticalSection",
      "signature": "void LockCrtCriticalSection(int nLockIndex)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Acquires a CRT critical section lock by index.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if critical section at nLockIndex is initialized\n2. If null, allocate 0x18 bytes for CRITICAL_SECTION structure\n3. Lock master lock (index 0x11) for thread-safe initialization\n4. If still null after lock, initialize and store pointer\n5. If another thread initialized it, free allocated memory\n6. Unlock master lock via FUN_6fc45432\n7. Enter the critical section\n\nParameters:\n- nLockIndex (int): Index into g_apCritSectTable (0-47)\n\nReturns:\n- void (holds lock on return)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x18 (24): sizeof(CRITICAL_SECTION)\n- 0x11 (17): Master lock index for lazy initialization\n\nRelated Functions:\n- FUN_6fc45432: LeaveCriticalSection wrapper\n- DeleteAllCriticalSections: Cleanup at CRT shutdown",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:5ba7875cbad7a3d5fce31ff25fd40455",
