      "name": "InitializeThreadLocalStorage",
      "signature": "int InitializeThreadLocalStorage(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes Thread Local Storage (TLS) for CRT thread data.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize static critical sections for thread synchronization\n2. Allocate a TLS index via TlsAlloc\n3. Allocate 0x74 bytes for per-thread data structure\n4. Store pointer in TLS slot via TlsSetValue\n5. Initialize structure fields (thread ID, default handle)\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- 1 on success\n- 0 on failure (TLS alloc, memory alloc, or TlsSetValue failed)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x74 (116): Size of per-thread TLS data structure\n- 0xFFFFFFFF: Invalid handle/TLS index sentinel\n\nRelated Functions:\n- InitializeStaticCriticalSections: Sets up critical sections\n- InitTlsDataStruct: Initializes TLS data structure fields",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:1563254ce315644019ac4e0b71caac74",
