      "comment": "Writes a string of nLen characters to FILE buffer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Loop through each character in szSrc\n2. Call WriteCharToBuffer for each character\n3. Abort early if write error occurs (pnBytesWritten = -1)\n\nParameters:\n- szSrc (char*): Source string to write\n- nLen (int): Number of characters to write\n- pFile (FILE*): Destination file stream\n- pnBytesWritten (int*): Tracks bytes written, -1 on error\n\nReturns:\n- void (error signaled via pnBytesWritten = -1)",
