      "comment": "Unlocks CRT critical section 9 (heap lock) after memory allocation operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push critical section index 9 onto stack\n2. Call UnlockCrtCriticalSection to release the lock\n3. Clean up stack (POP ECX) and return\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- LockCrtCriticalSection: Acquires the same critical section\n- Called after HeapAlloc/HeapReAlloc operations in realloc path",
