      "name": "InitializeCrtHeap",
      "signature": "bool InitializeCrtHeap(int nSerialize)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes CRT private heap for memory management.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Create heap via HeapCreate (serialized if nSerialize == 0)\n2. Store heap handle in g_hCrtHeap\n3. Get heap selection mode via GetHeapSelectionMode\n4. Initialize heap structures based on mode:\n   - Mode 3: Call FUN_6fc48187(0x3f8) for small-block heap init\n   - Mode 2: Call FUN_6fc48cce for alternate heap init\n   - Other: Return success immediately\n5. If init succeeds, return 1; else destroy heap and return 0\n\nParameters:\n- nSerialize (int): 0 = create serialized (thread-safe) heap, non-zero = no serialization\n\nReturns:\n- 1 (true) on success\n- 0 (false) on failure (heap creation failed or init failed)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1000: Initial heap size (4KB)\n- 0x3f8 (1016): Small-block heap init parameter\n- 3: Heap mode for small-block heap\n- 2: Heap mode for alternate heap type",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:15aa81e73603ef0f9aff675af9b3ec8c",
