      "name": "_FF_MSGBANNER",
      "signature": "void _FF_MSGBANNER(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Displays runtime error message banner for fatal CRT errors.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if app type is console (1) OR (app type is 0 AND error mode is 1)\n2. If conditions met, call message handler with 0xFC (pre-message signal)\n3. If user handler (g_pfnUserMsgHandler) is registered, invoke it\n4. Call message handler with 0xFF (post-message signal)\n\nParameters:\n- None (void function)\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xFC (252): Pre-message banner signal to _NMSG_WRITE\n- 0xFF (255): Post-message banner signal to _NMSG_WRITE\n- 1: Console application type / error mode enabled\n\nRelated Functions:\n- __amsg_exit: Caller that terminates after message display\n- FUN_6fc46f00: _NMSG_WRITE - writes actual error messages",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:9765460a30498931557fab10cfc0be00",
