      "name": "FreeWithHeapStrategy",
      "signature": "void FreeWithHeapStrategy(void * pBlock)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Frees memory using the appropriate heap strategy based on g_dwHeapMode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return early if pBlock is NULL\n2. If g_dwHeapMode == 3 (heap block mode):\n   - Lock critical section 9\n   - Find heap block containing pBlock via FUN_6fc481cf\n   - If found, unlink block via FUN_6fc481fa and return\n3. If g_dwHeapMode == 2 (small block heap mode):\n   - Lock critical section 9\n   - Find SBH region via FUN_6fc48f2a\n   - If found, mark free via FUN_6fc48f81 and return\n4. Otherwise, call HeapFree directly on g_hCrtHeap\n\nParameters:\n- pBlock (void*): Memory block to free, may be NULL\n\nReturns:\n- void",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
