      "name": "LowLevelSeek",
      "signature": "DWORD LowLevelSeek(uint dwHandle, long lOffset, DWORD dwOrigin)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Seeks to a position in a file (CRT _lseek wrapper).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate file handle against g_dwIoHandleCount\n2. Check IO info table for valid open file (flag & 0x1)\n3. Lock critical section via FUN_6fc49eee\n4. Call FUN_6fc47427 (SetFilePointer wrapper)\n5. Unlock critical section via FUN_6fc49f4d\n6. If invalid handle, set errno=9 (EBADF) and return -1\n\nParameters:\n- dwHandle (uint): CRT file descriptor number\n- lOffset (long): Byte offset for seek operation\n- dwOrigin (DWORD): Origin (0=SEEK_SET, 1=SEEK_CUR, 2=SEEK_END)\n\nReturns:\n- New file position on success\n- 0xFFFFFFFF (-1) on error\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): IO info entry stride in g_apIoInfoTable\n- 0x1: Flag bit for valid/open file handle\n- 9: EBADF errno value (bad file descriptor)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:bac569fc88fbfeebd4a5205bbcce1faf",
