      "name": "IsHandleTextMode",
      "signature": "byte IsHandleTextMode(uint dwHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Checks if file handle has text mode flag set (CRT internal).\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate handle is within g_dwIoHandleCount\n2. Index into g_apIoInfoTable using handle / 32 and handle % 32\n3. Return bit 0x40 of flags byte at offset 4 in IoInfo struct\n\nParameters:\n- dwHandle (uint): File descriptor / handle index\n\nReturns:\n- 0x40 if text mode is set\n- 0 if binary mode or handle out of bounds\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1F (31): Mask for index within IoInfo block\n- 0x5: Right shift to get block index (divide by 32)\n- 0x24 (36): Size of IoInfo structure entry\n- 0x40 (64): Text mode flag (_IOTEXT)",
