      "name": "UnlockFilePointer",
      "signature": "void UnlockFilePointer(FILE * pFile)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Unlocks a FILE pointer after CRT file operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pFile is within CRT file table (0x6fc4e458-0x6fc4e6b8)\n2. If CRT file: compute table index and call UnlockCrtCriticalSection\n3. Else: call LeaveCriticalSection on embedded critical section\n\nParameters:\n- pFile (FILE*): File pointer to unlock\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6fc4e458: CRT file table start address\n- 0x6fc4e6b8: CRT file table end address\n- 0x20: Offset to embedded CRITICAL_SECTION in FILE\n- 0x1c: Base index offset for CRT critical sections",
