      "name": "UnlockFileOrCrtCriticalSection",
      "signature": "void UnlockFileOrCrtCriticalSection(int nLockIndex, void * pFile)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Unlocks a file or CRT critical section based on lock index.\n\nCounterpart to LockFileOrCrtCriticalSection - releases the lock\nacquired by that function using the same index-based dispatch.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if nLockIndex < 0x14 (20)\n2. If true, unlock CRT critical section at index nLockIndex + 0x1C\n3. Otherwise, leave file's embedded critical section at pFile + 0x20\n\nParameters:\n- nLockIndex (int): Lock index determining unlock path\n- pFile (void*): Pointer to file structure with embedded CRITICAL_SECTION\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated Functions:\n- LockFileOrCrtCriticalSection: Corresponding lock function",
