      "comment": "Converts a wide character to multibyte string representation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Return 0 if destination buffer is NULL\n2. If locale code page is 0 (ASCII mode):\n   - If wcChar < 0x100, write single byte and return 1\n   - Otherwise fall through to error\n3. If locale code page set, use WideCharToMultiByte API:\n   - Flags 0x220 = WC_COMPOSITECHECK | WC_NO_BEST_FIT_CHARS\n   - Return byte count on success\n4. On failure, set errno to 0x2a (ERANGE) and return -1\n\nParameters:\n- szDest (char*): Destination buffer for multibyte output\n- wcChar (ushort): Wide character to convert\n\nReturns:\n- Positive: Number of bytes written to destination\n- 0: NULL destination buffer\n- -1: Conversion failed (errno set to ERANGE)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:12dead7d93dd2763acf5540fd9895c41",
