      "comment": "Counts characters in pszString until encountering any character from pszCharSet.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Build 256-bit charset bitmap from pszCharSet bytes\n2. Scan pszString character by character\n3. For each char, test if bit is set in charset bitmap\n4. Return count when charset char found or null terminator reached\n\nParameters:\n- pszString (char*): String to scan\n- pszCharSet (char*): Characters to search for\n\nReturns:\n- Length of initial segment not containing any charset characters",
