      "name": "SbhCoalesceFreeBlock",
      "signature": "void SbhCoalesceFreeBlock(uint * pRegionHeader, int nBlockEnd)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Coalesces a freed block with adjacent free blocks in small block heap.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compute page index from block address relative to region base\n2. Check if next block (after current) is free - coalesce if so\n3. Check if previous block is free - coalesce if so\n4. Update free list bitmaps (0x44/0xC4 tables) and counts\n5. Link coalesced block into appropriate size bucket\n6. If page becomes completely empty, decommit or release region\n\nParameters:\n- pRegionHeader (uint*): SBH region header with bitmap/metadata\n- nBlockEnd (int): Pointer to end of block being freed\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8000: Page size (32KB)\n- 0x204: Per-page metadata stride\n- 0x144: Free list offset in region\n- 0x3F (63): Max bucket index\n- 0x20 (32): Boundary between low/high bitmap\n- 0x44/0xC4: Low/high bitmap offsets",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:ef5171f8f7487cff01081036951ae8fa",
