      "name": "SbhInitializePage",
      "signature": "int SbhInitializePage(void * pSbhBlock)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Initializes a page in the small block heap region.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Find next available page index by counting leading zeros in page bitmap\n2. Initialize 63 free list link pairs for the page descriptor\n3. Commit 32KB virtual memory for the page via VirtualAlloc\n4. Initialize free block headers in 4KB chunks (8 blocks per page)\n5. Link first and last free blocks to page descriptor free list\n6. Update page metadata and clear availability bit in block bitmap\n\nParameters:\n- pSbhBlock (void*): Pointer to SBH block control structure\n\nReturns:\n- Page index (0-31) on success\n- -1 on VirtualAlloc failure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x8000: Page size (32KB)\n- 0x204: Page descriptor stride\n- 0x144: Page descriptor base offset\n- 0x3f: Number of free list size classes (63)\n- 0x1000: Block size within page (4KB)\n- 0xff0: Free block size marker (4080 bytes)\n- 0x1c00: Page end offset for block initialization",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:0002c858ef3942a0b403454c72674bfe",
