      "name": "SehLocalUnwindHelper",
      "signature": "void SehLocalUnwindHelper(void * pExceptionFrame)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "SEH local unwind helper function for exception handling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load EBP from exception frame (offset 0x0)\n2. Extract scope table pointer from frame (offset 0x18)\n3. Extract target scope index from frame (offset 0x1c)\n4. Call __local_unwind2 to perform stack unwinding\n\nParameters:\n- pExceptionFrame (void*): Pointer to SEH exception registration frame\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nStructure Layout:\n  +0x00: Saved EBP\n  +0x18: Scope table pointer\n  +0x1c: Target scope index\n\nRelated Functions:\n- __local_unwind2: Performs the actual local unwind operation",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:89d1b619054116ad559c7c543db397fd",
