      "name": "ResolveCodePageSpecifier",
      "signature": "uint ResolveCodePageSpecifier(int nCodePageSpec)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Resolves special code page specifiers to actual code page numbers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nCodePageSpec is -2, return OEM code page via GetOEMCP()\n2. If nCodePageSpec is -3, return ACP code page via GetACP()\n3. If nCodePageSpec is -4, return g_uDefaultCodePage\n4. Otherwise return nCodePageSpec unchanged\n\nParameters:\n- nCodePageSpec (int): Code page specifier (-2=OEM, -3=ACP, -4=default, else literal)\n\nReturns:\n- Actual code page number (uint)\n\nSide Effects:\n- Sets g_fCodePageResolved to 1 for special values (-2/-3/-4), 0 otherwise",
