      "comment": "Converts Windows code page IDs to corresponding locale IDs for CJK languages.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compare input code page against known CJK code pages\n2. Return corresponding LCID for matched code page\n3. Return 0 if code page not in mapping table\n\nParameters:\n- dwCodePage (uint): Windows code page identifier\n\nReturns:\n- Locale ID (LCID) for the code page, or 0 if not found\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x3a4 (932): Japanese Shift-JIS code page\n- 0x3a8 (936): Simplified Chinese GBK code page\n- 0x3b5 (949): Korean code page\n- 0x3b6 (950): Traditional Chinese Big5 code page\n- 0x411 (1041): Japanese LCID\n- 0x804 (2052): Simplified Chinese LCID\n- 0x412 (1042): Korean LCID\n- 0x404 (1028): Traditional Chinese (Taiwan) LCID",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:f31c6439952ca9c3e10694cce3d833df",
