      "name": "InitCodePageCharTables",
      "signature": "void InitCodePageCharTables(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes character type and case conversion tables for the current code page.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get code page info via GetCPInfo for g_dwCurrentCodePage\n2. If successful:\n   a. Initialize szCharTable with bytes 0x00-0xFF, set index 0 to space\n   b. Mark lead bytes as spaces (for DBCS code pages)\n   c. Call GetStringTypeInternal to get CT_CTYPE1 character types\n   d. Call LCMapStringWithLocale with LCMAP_UPPERCASE (0x100) and LCMAP_LOWERCASE (0x200)\n   e. For each character: set 0x10 (uppercase) or 0x20 (lowercase) flag in g_abCharTypeTable,\n      store case-converted char in g_abCaseConvTable\n3. If GetCPInfo fails (fallback to ASCII):\n   a. For A-Z: set 0x10 flag, store lowercase conversion (char + 0x20)\n   b. For a-z: set 0x20 flag, store uppercase conversion (char - 0x20)\n   c. For other chars: store 0 in g_abCaseConvTable\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x100: LCMAP_UPPERCASE\n- 0x200: LCMAP_LOWERCASE\n- 0x10: Uppercase flag in g_abCharTypeTable\n- 0x20: Lowercase flag in g_abCharTypeTable\n- 0x41-0x5A: ASCII 'A'-'Z'\n- 0x61-0x7A: ASCII 'a'-'z'",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:63906d1f35f7842042066a6643d2050c",
