      "name": "strtol",
      "signature": "int strtol(char * szInput, char * * ppszEnd, int nBase)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Converts string to long integer with automatic base detection.\n\nWrapper for internal string-to-long conversion routine.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Push 0 as flags parameter (no special parsing flags)\n2. Push caller's base, end pointer, and input string parameters\n3. Call internal strtol implementation (FUN_6fc49993)\n4. Clean up stack and return result\n\nParameters:\n- szInput (char*): Null-terminated string to parse\n- ppszEnd (char**): Receives pointer past parsed chars, or NULL to ignore\n- nBase (int): Number base 0=auto, 2-36 valid\n\nReturns:\n- Parsed long value on success\n- 0 on failure or empty input",
