      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Compiler-generated stack probe for large stack allocations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. EAX contains requested stack size in bytes\n2. Probe each 4KB page by touching memory to trigger guard pages\n3. Adjust ESP to allocate the requested stack space\n4. Return to caller with adjusted stack\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: EAX contains stack allocation size in bytes\n\nReturns:\n- void (ESP adjusted, stack allocated)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1000 (4096): Page size for stack probing",
