      "name": "CloseLockedCrtHandle",
      "signature": "int CloseLockedCrtHandle(uint dwCrtHandle)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Closes a CRT file handle with proper locking.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate handle is in range and marked as allocated\n2. Lock the I/O handle for thread safety\n3. Call CloseCrtHandle to close the underlying OS handle\n4. Unlock the I/O handle\n5. Return result from close operation\n\nParameters:\n- dwCrtHandle (uint): CRT file descriptor to close\n\nReturns:\n- 0 on success\n- -1 on error (errno set to EBADF for invalid handle)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x24 (36): IoInfo structure stride\n- 9: EBADF errno value (bad file descriptor)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
